OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly cloudy and mainly dry, a
OL,6,Ffew light showers possible across
OL,7,FLanarkshire. Dry with more of the way
OL,8,Fof sunshine across western Argyll.
OL,9,FLight winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA mostly cloudy evening and
OL,12,Fnight with a few light showers, these
OL,13,Fmainly across Glasgow and Lanarkshire.
OL,14,FAny cloud breaks across the northwest
OL,15,Fwill lead to patchy frost and fog.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FLittle change, remaining
OL,18,Frather cloudy with a few light
OL,19,Fshowers, these mainly in the east.
OL,20,FBrighter across the northwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
